#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:3
msgid "Nixl"
msgstr "Nixl"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:8
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:10
msgid ""
"NIXL (NVIDIA Inference Xfer Library) is a high-performance library designed "
"for accelerating point to point communications in AI inference frameworks. "
"It provides an abstraction over various types of memory (CPU and GPU) and "
"storage through a modular plug-in architecture, enabling efficient data "
"transfer and coordination between different components of the inference "
"pipeline."
msgstr ""
"NIXL（NVIDIA 推理传输库）是一个高性能库，专为加速 AI 推理框架中的点对点通信而设计。它通过模块化插件架构为各种类型的内存（CPU 和 "
"GPU）和存储提供抽象，实现推理管道中不同组件之间的高效数据传输和协调。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:12
msgid ""
"LMCache supports using NIXL as a storage backend, allowing using NIXL to "
"save either GPU or CPU memory into storage."
msgstr "LMCache 支持使用 NIXL 作为存储后端，允许使用 NIXL 将 GPU 或 CPU 内存保存到存储中。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:15
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:17
msgid "**LMCache**: Install with ``pip install lmcache``"
msgstr "**LMCache**：使用 ``pip install lmcache`` 安装"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:18
msgid ""
"**NIXL**: Install from `NIXL GitHub repository <https://github.com/ai-"
"dynamo/nixl>`_"
msgstr "**NIXL**：从 `NIXL GitHub 仓库 <https://github.com/ai-dynamo/nixl>`_ 安装"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Model Access**: Valid Hugging Face token (HF_TOKEN) for Llama 3.1 8B "
"Instruct"
msgstr "**模型访问**：用于 Llama 3.1 8B Instruct 的有效 Hugging Face 令牌（HF_TOKEN）"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:22
msgid "Ways to configure LMCache NIXL Offloading"
msgstr "配置 LMCache NIXL 卸载的方法"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:24
msgid "**Configuration File**:"
msgstr "**配置文件**："

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:26
msgid "Passed in through ``LMCACHE_CONFIG_FILE=lmcache-config.yaml``"
msgstr "通过 ``LMCACHE_CONFIG_FILE=lmcache-config.yaml`` 传入"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:28
msgid "``LMCACHE_USE_EXPERIMENTAL`` MUST be set."
msgstr "``LMCACHE_USE_EXPERIMENTAL`` 必须设置。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:30
msgid "Example ``lmcache-config.yaml`` for POSIX backend:"
msgstr "POSIX 后端的 `lmcache-config.yaml` 示例："

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:43
msgid "Key settings:"
msgstr "关键设置："

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:45
msgid "``nixl_buffer_size``: buffer size for NIXL transfers."
msgstr "``nixl_buffer_size``：NIXL 传输的缓冲区大小。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:47
msgid ""
"``nixl_pool_size``: number of descriptors opened at init time for nixl "
"backend."
msgstr "`nixl_pool_size`：在 nixl 后端初始化时打开的描述符数量。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:49
msgid ""
"``nixl_path``: directory under which the storage files will be saved (e.g. "
"/mnt/nixl/). Needed for NIXL backends that store to file."
msgstr "``nixl_path``：存储文件将保存的目录（例如 /mnt/nixl/）。对于存储到文件的 NIXL 后端是必需的。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:51
msgid ""
"``nixl_buffer_device``: dictates where the memory managed by NIXL should be "
"on. \"cpu\" or \"cuda\" is supported for \"GDS\" and \"GDS_MT\" backends - "
"for \"POSIX\", \"HF3FS\" & \"OBJ\", must be \"cpu\"."
msgstr ""
"`nixl_buffer_device`：指定 NIXL 管理的内存应该位于何处。对于 \"GDS\" 和 \"GDS_MT\" 后端支持 "
"\"cpu\" 或 \"cuda\" - 对于 \"POSIX\"、\"HF3FS\" 和 \"OBJ\"，必须为 \"cpu\"。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:53
msgid ""
"``nixl_backend``: configuration of which nixl backend to use for storage."
msgstr "`nixl_backend`：用于配置存储所使用的 nixl 后端。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:57
msgid "Supported backends are: [\"GDS\", \"GDS_MT\", \"POSIX\", \"HF3FS\", \"OBJ\"]."
msgstr "支持的后端有：[\"GDS\", \"GDS_MT\", \"POSIX\", \"HF3FS\", \"OBJ\"]。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/nixl.rst:59
msgid ""
"Backend specific params should be provided via "
"``extra_config.nixl_backend_params``. Please refer to NIXL documentation for"
" specifics."
msgstr "后端特定参数应通过 ``extra_config.nixl_backend_params`` 提供。具体信息请参考 NIXL 文档。"

